#. ~ MOD name
#: modinfo.json
msgid "Berserk: Extended tileset (Chibi / MSX+ / Undead)"
msgstr "剑风传奇：扩展图块集（Chibi / MSX+ / Undead）"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Berserk: Extended tileset (Chibi / MSX+ / Undead)"
#: modinfo.json
msgid "Optional tileset patch when using Chibi_Ultica, MshockXottoplus (MSX+), or Undead People tilesets. Adds Ber_Suit equipment and sword art plus baseline monster sprites. Does not replace the main mod's UltimateCataclysm tileset."
msgstr "适用于 Chibi_Ultica、MshockXottoplus（MSX+）和 Undead People 图块集的可选贴图补丁。为 Ber_Suit 装备、剑和部分怪物添加贴图，不会替换主模组的 UltimateCataclysm 贴图。"

#: modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Optional art for Chibi_Ultica, MSX+ and Undead People: armor, swords and "
"some monsters. The main mod already includes its own art for "
"UltimateCataclysm."
msgstr ""
"为 Chibi_Ultica、MSX+ 与 Undead People 提供额外的盔甲、武器和部分怪物贴图。主模组已经包含适用于 "
"UltimateCataclysm 的贴图。"
